<!--
  The status-bar mark.

  A single flat silhouette on transparency, because that is all the system keeps: it discards
  every colour in a small icon and re-tints the alpha channel to match the shade. Anything drawn
  with strokes, holes or a gradient arrives as a grey blob, which is why the launcher icon cannot
  be reused here.

  What it draws is the app's own shape at its simplest — a pawn on a plinth, the piece the whole
  game is about — at the 24 dp the platform asks for, with the subject inside the middle 18 dp so
  the system's own padding does not clip it.
-->
